# The guide Left/Back sequence from the C1 trial, for cargo xtask tv-replay.
#
# Start: the app on the guide with the focus at live and nothing playing, as it starts with
# nothing played (or with Settings > General > Last channel on start off). With a channel playing
# the Back at `closed` returns to the player instead, and the Left after it seeks. What each shot
# should show is beside it. The same sequence runs on the host in crates/app/src/shell/tests/nav.rs
# (guide_left_walks_into_the_past_and_back_opens_the_groups_panel).

shot start          # the guide at live, the preview top left
Left x3             # three programmes back in time on the same channel
shot left           # still the grid: no groups panel, no menu
hold Left 2000      # held, Left keeps walking into the past
shot left-held
Back                # back to the current time
shot live
Back                # the groups panel over the left of the guide; the preview stays put
shot groups
Back                # nothing plays, so the panel only closes: focus and time as before it opened
shot closed
Left                # Left walks into the past again
Back                # and Back returns to live
shot live-again
